Z||000020||Alex4mula||10-10-2001||08:51 AM||||I used an angle grinder with a carbide blade to cut my suspension springs. Took me about 1 minute each. Last time I did it I used a hacksaw. Took me 35 min. each that time. Good that you learn from experience  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
